// P3.11 / PS20.4: a loft's Normal direction and Tangent direction conditions, each with a picked
// vector (the closed forms asserted in the kernel's `loft_direction_conditions` and the feature
// list's `loft_normal_and_tangent_direction`). A 20 × 20 square on Top is lofted to a Ø20
// circle on Plane 1, 40 above it; Sketch 3 on Front holds one line leaning 14° towards +X (from
// (25, 0) to (35, 40)), the picked direction. Plane 1 stays shown, as Onshape shows a plane
// feature (nothing else stays highlighted after ✓).
// 01 Start profile condition Normal direction, its Start direction field holding Sketch 3's
//    line (picked in the view): the loft leaves the square along the line, leaning towards +X,
//    and bends back to the circle; the direction's arrow (selection amber) stands on the
//    square's middle, along the loft (fix round 1: a direction in the profile's plane gave a
//    sliver fin at the square's corner; this one leans cleanly).
// 02 End profile condition Tangent direction with the same line as its End direction and End
//    magnitude 0.2: the loft rolls into the circle along the plane square to the line (with a
//    large magnitude the side where that tilted plane rises would lift above the circle, as
//    any tangency to it must); a second arrow on the circle's centre.
// 03 accepted: one part, Loft 1; no arrows once the dialog is closed.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("sketch top rect -10 -10 10 10"),
        Key("P"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Click(ui("plane")),
        WaitFor("plane-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-top")),
        Click(ui("plane-offset-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("40"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Click(ui("feature-plane-1")),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Key("C"),
        ClickWorld(0, 0),
        ClickWorld(10, 0),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Custom("sketch front chain 25 0 35 40"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        Click(ui("loft")),
        WaitFor("loft-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(5, -5, 0)),
        Click(xyz(3, 3, 40)),
        Click(ui("loft-start-condition")),
        Click(ui("loft-start-condition-option-5")),
        Click(ui("loft-start-direction-field")),
        Click(xyz(30, 0, 20)),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-normal-direction-line"),
        Click(ui("loft-end-condition")),
        Click(ui("loft-end-condition-option-6")),
        Click(ui("loft-end-direction-field")),
        Click(xyz(30, 0, 20)),
        Click(ui("loft-end-magnitude-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.2"),
        Key("Tab"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-tangent-direction-line"),
        Click(ui("loft-dialog-accept")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-accepted"),
    ],
)
